- [Upgrading code |upgrade], when you also move to a new version of Nette or another library along with the new PHP version.
- [The upgrading section |decisions/upgrading] with all the decisions about upgrading to a newer PHP, and [the whole set `modernizations` |php-coding-standards#modernizations].

